### FINDING_1:
- **Reviewer(s)**: Codex-dyn-head-ordering
- **Severity**: important
- **Focus area**: risk-integration
- **Location**: <TMPDIR>/plan.txt:7-9; skills/implement/references/rebase-rebump-subprocedure.md:3-5; scripts/ship-pr.sh:2341-2377,2434-2439
